ows what else I can do? Damage over time? Fire rate? What do I build on? Each playthrough can find something different.\n\nYou'll definitely be wanting to give this game more than a few hours.", "timestamp_created": 1427823446, "timestamp_updated": 1427823446, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15141074", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979434827", "personaname": "IceCreamMan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CustomURL5567/", "num_games_owned": 210, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1285, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1051, "last_played": 1505285515, "avatar": "a214c76cfdc614af36fd64ad0ef496e6fe6405a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun stuff.", "timestamp_created": 1427811725, "timestamp_updated": 1427811725, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15137227", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058002686", "personaname": "VeliusFox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/veliusfox/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 9959, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3079, "last_played": 1589952729, "avatar": "e06a61d515daf637a27cefaac03f5f8743f40f91"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is hard. \nThis game is frustrating as hell. \n\n[b][i]But I love it.[/i][/b] \n\nKeep pushing on, and unlock new things, you won't regret it.", "timestamp_created": 1427789845, "timestamp_update